I have tested that it with Octave and it doesn't work without modifications. Unfortunately InputParser in Octave has slightly incompatible syntax compared to Matlab's InputParser. Fixing that is not difficult. If I remember correctly, I did test quick fix for InputParser syntax, but then there was other problems with object class definition syntax in MatlabProcessManager (required by MatlabStan) and I did not have time to investigate further. So it is unclear how much work it would require to get it work in Octave.

Aki

