Maybe something like:

for (j in 1:J) {

  sub_row(alpha,j,2,T-1) ~ normal(sub_row(alpha,j,1,T-1),sigma_alpha[j]);
}
or

for (j in 1:J) {

  0.0 ~ normal(sub_row(alpha,j,1,T-1)-sub_row(alpha,j,2,T-1),sigma_alpha[j]);
}

Cheers,
Marcus

