Subject: Are these jags model features possible in stan
Message-ID: <rCm5CK7T2Gw.rxv2q_LZydIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/rCm5CK7T2Gw/m/rxv2q_LZydIJ>
