From: u3f22b207863d2049 at groups.google.com (Luc Coffeng)
Date: Tue, 21 Oct 2014 07:20:52 +0000
Subject: Re: How to run a robit model in Stan?
Message-ID: <DcN_0w7KAoo.VsBw1iuwgHAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <DcN_0w7KAoo.Pk2mQKBpWAoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <DcN_0w7KAoo.Pk2mQKBpWAoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
