Xulong:

Your model below looks pretty simple. I’d suggest just fitting models 1 and 2 simultaneously (with appropriate relabelings of the error terms).  One virtue of the Bayesian approach as implemented in Stan is that you can just throw down a simultaneous equations model and estimate it all at once with no tricks.

A

