Hi, first, let me suggest that maybe 2000 iterations is more than you need.  I think a total effective sample size of 100 should be enough for most purposes.
Second, I’m not sure what your model is (and don’t really have the time to try to understand it); I’m just making the generic point that, if you were planning to take estimates from model 1 and pipe them into model 2, I expect you’d be better off just expressing the two parts of the model together as one single model with measurement error.
A

