Subject: Re: [stan-users] Mixed model of cross classified data: parallel traceplots and R.hat >1000
Message-ID: <yzw4RfveHtg.iNt54y6pLGgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <yzw4RfveHtg.nEGy5YIhf1wJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <yzw4RfveHtg.0CtZMISZ5sAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <yzw4RfveHtg.nEGy5YIhf1wJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
